# Tracer: arithmetic IR preserves grouping in identity and equality indexes.
# Before (unsoundly accepted):
# (2^3)^2 = 64
# 2^(3^2) = 512
# 64 = 512
# Both powers used the IR key "2 ^ 3 ^ 2".
# Now: distinct keys; true values remain provable.
(2^3)^2 = 64
2^(3^2) = 512
not (2^3)^2 = 2^(3^2)
# Boundary: 64 = 512 and the direct false equality must be rejected.
# Executable negative regressions: tests/structural_ir_tuple.rs.
# Evidence: target/release/litex -strict -lang en -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_they_are_the_same/structural_arithmetic_ir.lit
